Z||000006||LarryB||01-25-2001||07:03 PM||||You remove the old covers, and depending on what you want to do you either remove and reuse the seat back padding or you can get new styrofoam pads.  The new covers come with a video tape that shows you exactly what to do.  It's not hard to do at all, except if you do both seats in 1 day your hands will be pretty tired. <P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by sqoach:<BR><B>josh, that looks good. do they just slip over the seats? or do you have to rip off the old stuff?<P>BTW, did you get the money i sent you yet?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
