Z||000008||BAM-BAM||01-25-2001||08:11 PM|||| Here's my Mr.Mike's seats!!!!<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroseats.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroseats_1.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroseats3.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroseats2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dashcolor.jpg">  <P> They are really easy to do, just follow the video. I also  added an extra inch of padding on all the bolsters. Well worth the money. The last pic is of my new edash color, just thought I'd throw that one in  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>  Peace, B2 OUT!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 01-25-2001).]||||reg||1
